      "writtenOn": "2022-08-11T00:01:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The goal here is to figure out if \"chipset_force_shutdown()\" was called with \"CHIPSET_SHUTDOWN_POWERFAIL\" as the reason argument.\n\nOne alternative I considered was storing the chipset shutdown reason and making a getter for it. But the way the chipset code is set up as a common interface, it would require adding the functionality to each chipset implementation and there are dozens of them. Let me know if this is preferable.",
      "parentUuid": "0b4801dd_3d03056c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 447,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 447,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "40fea1be07f9e929fb45af88817cab542c833678",
