      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-11T20:39:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think a `chipset_get_shutdown_reason()` API would make more sense, as it would remove the possibility that we have inconsistent state between the shutdown reason and the power_failure flag.",
